offered under the same terms as Ruffle itself:

    MIT OR Apache-2.0

at your option. Full texts:

    https://github.com/ruffle-rs/ruffle/blob/master/LICENSE.md

They are deliberately NOT under the project's PolyForm Noncommercial license (see
../LICENSE): a patch is a derivative work of Ruffle, and a noncommercial license
would make it impossible to offer these changes upstream.

